{"id":"58d4ef04d6476ad5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-enumerability-in-system.md","title":"Enumeration by a Formula in a System","display":"df-enumerability-in-system — Enumeration by a Formula in a System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-enumerability-in-system","aliases":["92-df-enumerability-in-system"],"display":"df-enumerability-in-system — Enumeration by a Formula in a System","source":"第 V 章 pp. 61、63（PDF 78、80）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-enumerability-in-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-enumerability-in-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-enumerability-in-system — Enumeration by a Formula in a System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 61、63（PDF 78、80）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a>的二元实例操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 是下文定义的枚举关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerability\\text{-}in\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerability\\text{-}in\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书“在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中可枚举”的证明论定义，与外部 c.e. 及闭合理论的有效可公理化均不同。若系统没有有效证明枚举，不能由本定义直接得到外部算法。成员只需一个正见证，非成员需每个见证的负实例可证。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 61、63（PDF 78、80）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2$ 是[[92-df-formula-instance]]的二元实例操作；$\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 是下文定义的枚举关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}enumerability\\text{-}in\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[&\n(n\\in A\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\\\\n&\\land(n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar n,\\bar m))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1673,"backlinks":[{"id":"916e46a7ff7a4753","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本节点的 $\\mathrm{EA}_G(T)$ 针对闭合理论定理码集的外部 c.e. 性；原书“enumerable in S”是存在二元公式，在成员处有可证见证、在非成员处所有见证均可反驳，见[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]。两者不可互换。"},{"id":"2121ca396d7d67ab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"521018a78a163e38","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]、[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]与[[92-df-omega-consistency]]给出原书关于表示和 $\\omega$ 相容性的契约。本地固定 PA 的对应结果见[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","8bd18c4d476f594a","51c43e0240787ebb"]}